i--- Web Applications -------------------------------------------------	header null 0

The concept of a web application these days is, sadly, of a
full-fledged desktop application that runs in your browser, with
millions of lines of obfuscated Javascript, and sometimes other
languages compiled to WebAssembly and running straight on your
browser. The web applications that I have developed are nothing like
that, never will be, and are basically what you would expect a web
application to be back in 2010.

1PickLE	./pickle
Web application for managing and using electronic component pick lists

1Litter Box	./litterbox
Simple solution to upload and share files quickly with strangers

1PHP Photo Viewer	./php-photo-viewer
Super lightweight and retro-friendly PHP 5.4 photo viewer website

